      "command_or_method": "New documentary dependency comparison against exact preserved pre-edit inputs and unchanged scenario/consumer/oracle scope; historical executions not rerun.",
      "observed_result": "T004 checkbox/closure note now agrees with the already recorded four bounded consumer observations; scenario/spec, skill source, concrete consumer and oracle are unchanged. Recorded scope: Separate Iced 0.14 graphical consumer under dedicated Xwayland; actual XTEST input, widget focus query, captures at 240x180/1600x1000 and relayout counters. Detail text persists; collapse routes focus to command input, expand restores detail. No product UI/native Wayland or arbitrary-size acceptance. Recovery integration: the updated governance helper resolves authenticated documentary predecessors; the final governance suite and 439/439 recovery observation support that bounded change. These checks do not reaccept the 25 historical criteria or rerun product/skill consumers.",
